# work-strategy voices — granular use (tri-mind deprecated; minds superseded)

**`tri-mind` / `tri-frame` / `tutti` are deprecated** — [TRI-MIND-DEPRECATED.md](../../docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/TRI-MIND-DEPRECATED.md).

**Voices supersede minds** — [VOICES-SUPERSEDE-MINDS.md](../../docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/VOICES-SUPERSEDE-MINDS.md). Fork/gate: [`docs/archive/grace-mar.md`](../../docs/archive/grace-mar.md). For new work, **`statecraft/voices/<speaker>/<speaker>-profile.md`** is SSOT; **`strategy-expert-*-mind.md`** is compatibility only.

Do **not** assume **tri-frame** on every **`strategy`**, **`strategy pass`**, or **skill-strategy** pass.

**Default:** **Zero or one** named speaker lens — or **none**. Structured comparison → **`state-synthesis`**, **`primary-overhearing-analysis`**, or **[`periodic-statecraft-review` runbook](../../skills/runbooks/periodic-statecraft-review.runbook.md)** (`statecraft-multi-lens` archived).

**Named speaker (single):** When the operator names **Mercouris**, **Mearsheimer**, **Barnes**, or another mapped expert, read **`statecraft/voices/<speaker>/<speaker>-profile.md`** and render in authentic register per [minds-authentic-voice.mdc](minds-authentic-voice.mdc).

**LEARN MODE** tri-frame ordering is **legacy** — [LEARN_MODE_RULES.md](../../docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/LEARN_MODE_RULES.md) only when operator explicitly invokes archive LEARN protocol.

**Entry points:** [`statecraft/voices/README.md`](../../statecraft/voices/README.md) (canonical) · [`docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/minds/README.md`](../../docs/archive/skill-work-legacy/work-strategy/minds/README.md) (compatibility redirect).

**In-voice output:** Follow [`.cursor/rules/minds-authentic-voice.mdc`](minds-authentic-voice.mdc).
